      "expected": "The BMI088 PS pin must be tied to GND for I2C mode; the design uses I2C addresses 0x19/0x69.",
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "schematic", "quote": "U5 BMI088 pin 7 PS connected to +3.3V (NAVC Peripherals sheet)"},
